# 9. The DO statements need softening

There are several places where the resource gets a little too absolute.

For example:

> "DO below 40% saturation is lethal to most fish."

and:

> "Critical DO — fish kills likely."

:contentReference[oaicite:15]{index=15}

Duration, species, temperature, acclimation and other conditions matter enormously.

I'd teach:

> **Very low DO can cause severe physiological stress and, if sufficiently low and prolonged, fish mortality. The effect depends on species, temperature, duration and local conditions.**

Likewise your simulator shouldn't say:

> **"fish kills likely"**

simply because a mathematical model has generated <40%.

